PICO(1)            UW PICO 1.0 (1990)            PICO(1)

NAME
     pico - simple screen editor Hank installed

SYNOPSIS
     pico [ file ]

DESCRIPTION
     Paints with the terminal's ANSI sequences. It is not curses
     and it is not vi. ^X exits. ^O writes if the uid may write.
     A new buffer has no name until you give it a path.

     Installed March 1990. The man page was never finished.
